    "blurb": "Start building Camunda agents quickly",
    "overview": "A ready-to-use starting point for building agents with Camunda. This blueprint includes working examples of core agent capabilities: time and date awareness, configurable wait behavior, and Slack-based communication via message events.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Build your first Camunda agent with working examples",
    "splashDescription": "Building an agent from scratch means wiring together process logic, tool calls, and communication patterns before you can test anything meaningful. This blueprint removes that setup overhead by providing a working agent template with three pre-built capabilities: time and date retrieval, process wait behavior using Camunda's native event handling, and end-user communication via Slack message events. Use it as a starting point, extend the tools to fit your use case, and adapt the communication pattern to your preferred channel. It is designed for teams who want to move quickly from zero to a running agent without building boilerplate from scratch.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/829718/overview/img3693877949706366534.png?068e6e42dbcd47a2dd0421e578ff32a4",
